§ `Article 13(3): what the instructions for use contain`

-- Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 13 test the Annex I system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 13 test the Annex I system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 13 test the system placed earlier` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 13 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 13 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the identity and the contact details of the provider and, where applicable, of its authorised representative
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the characteristics, capabilities and limitations of performance of the high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain its intended purpose
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the level of accuracy, including its metrics, robustness and cybersecurity referred to in Article 15 against which the high-risk AI system has been tested and validated and which can be expected, and any known and foreseeable circumstances that may have an impact on that expected level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain any known or foreseeable circumstance, related to the use of the high-risk AI system in accordance with its intended purpose or under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse, which may lead to risks to the health and safety or fundamental rights referred to in Article 9(2)
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain where applicable, the technical capabilities and characteristics of the high-risk AI system to provide information that is relevant to explain its output
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain when appropriate, its performance regarding specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain when appropriate, specifications for the input data, or any other relevant information in terms of the training, validation and testing data sets used, taking into account the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain where applicable, information to enable deployers to interpret the output of the high-risk AI system and use it appropriately
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the changes to the high-risk AI system and its performance which have been pre-determined by the provider at the moment of the initial conformity assessment, if any
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the human oversight measures referred to in Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of the high-risk AI systems by the deployers
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain the computational and hardware resources needed, the expected lifetime of the high-risk AI system and any necessary maintenance and care measures, including their frequency, to ensure the proper functioning of that AI system, including as regards software updates
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the instructions for use contain where relevant, a description of the mechanisms included within the high-risk AI system that allows deployers to properly collect, store and interpret the logs in accordance with Article 12
#ASSERT `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 13 test the Annex III system` `Art 13 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
